1
00:00:07,705 --> 00:00:09,065
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:37,665 --> 00:01:42,705
‎ADAPTED FROM XI XING’S NOVEL
<i>‎QUEEN CHU</i>‎ ON QIDIAN.COM

3
00:01:48,545 --> 00:01:49,585
It was that imperial decree

4
00:01:49,665 --> 00:01:52,025
that allowed Her Highness
to successfully negotiate peace

5
00:01:52,105 --> 00:01:53,905
with the Lord of Xiaonan.

6
00:01:55,665 --> 00:01:58,505
Now that she's come here
to show her gratitude,

7
00:01:59,065 --> 00:02:01,145
it's evident she's realized

8
00:02:01,225 --> 00:02:04,105
she wouldn't achieve anything
without your support.

9
00:02:05,425 --> 00:02:07,265
Since Her Highness recognizes
your capability,

10
00:02:07,345 --> 00:02:11,705
this overture is probably
an attempt at an alliance.

11
00:02:11,785 --> 00:02:14,865
True power lies only in your own hands.

12
00:02:15,545 --> 00:02:16,865
With Chu Ling dead,

13
00:02:17,385 --> 00:02:19,945
the Yunzhong Prefecture
stands defenseless against its enemies.

14
00:02:20,465 --> 00:02:22,465
Even with Zhong Changrong in command,

15
00:02:22,545 --> 00:02:24,625
the Northern Desert
and the Xiaonan Prefecture

16
00:02:25,145 --> 00:02:26,745
are waiting to strike.

17
00:02:27,265 --> 00:02:30,345
A mere treaty is hardly enough
to hold them back.

18
00:02:31,985 --> 00:02:35,305
Back then, Xie Yanfang
defied my deployment order.

19
00:02:35,385 --> 00:02:37,585
Yet, in the relief of Xiaonan Prefecture,

20
00:02:38,105 --> 00:02:40,745
he seized the moment
and siphoned off the spoils.

21
00:02:42,065 --> 00:02:43,865
With the tides shifting,

22
00:02:43,945 --> 00:02:48,305
one must think thrice
before forming any alliance.

23
00:02:52,665 --> 00:02:54,265
LOTUS PAVILION

24
00:02:54,345 --> 00:02:57,065
Her Highness is corrupting
the noble ladies of the Capital,

25
00:02:57,145 --> 00:02:59,785
encouraging them
to parade themselves in public

26
00:02:59,865 --> 00:03:02,145
and organize the Chu Mansion
Literary Gathering.

27
00:03:03,505 --> 00:03:04,705
It is utterly laughable.

28
00:03:05,905 --> 00:03:07,905
What self-respecting scholar would attend?

29
00:03:07,985 --> 00:03:10,465
Mr. Jing, you truly amuse me.

30
00:03:14,185 --> 00:03:16,905
Why are men free
to enjoy literary pursuits,

31
00:03:16,985 --> 00:03:18,585
yet women are denied the same privilege?

32
00:03:19,545 --> 00:03:23,185
Could it be you fear
being outdone by women?

33
00:03:24,145 --> 00:03:25,345
Such bold words.

34
00:03:25,425 --> 00:03:30,505
Mr. Jing, we host this gathering
to let talent shine,

35
00:03:30,585 --> 00:03:35,105
unlike you and your fellow scholars

36
00:03:35,705 --> 00:03:38,585
who are nothing but incompetents
who slander behind closed doors.

37
00:03:39,345 --> 00:03:42,465
Talent is not something
one can claim as their own.

38
00:03:42,985 --> 00:03:43,945
Your boasting means nothing here.

39
00:03:44,025 --> 00:03:45,185
Good.

40
00:03:45,265 --> 00:03:48,985
Let's compete today so all may witness

41
00:03:49,585 --> 00:03:51,305
your true mettle.

42
00:03:51,385 --> 00:03:52,305
Very well.

43
00:03:52,385 --> 00:03:55,465
But if you lose,
stop slandering our gathering

44
00:03:55,545 --> 00:03:56,785
and never stop others from attending.

45
00:03:56,865 --> 00:03:57,865
Challenge accepted.

46
00:03:58,385 --> 00:03:59,625
Such insolence from a woman.

47
00:03:59,705 --> 00:04:03,585
Please enlighten me on Weiqi,

48
00:04:03,665 --> 00:04:06,505
calligraphy, and other finer arts.

49
00:04:15,105 --> 00:04:18,105
Tang, can you actually play Weiqi?

50
00:04:18,705 --> 00:04:21,465
I learned a little from Jiang before.

51
00:04:21,545 --> 00:04:24,265
That's enough to best him.

52
00:04:24,345 --> 00:04:26,025
What could you possibly learn
from a woman?

53
00:04:48,185 --> 00:04:49,225
Shall we continue?

54
00:04:52,745 --> 00:04:53,705
So what if you can play Weiqi?

55
00:04:54,505 --> 00:04:57,185
It's merely a trifling pastime
for women to occupy themselves with.

56
00:04:57,785 --> 00:04:59,425
-Exactly.
-Indeed.

57
00:04:59,505 --> 00:05:00,745
Let us compete in calligraphy instead.

58
00:05:00,825 --> 00:05:02,705
I have spent my time
immersed in literature.

59
00:05:03,465 --> 00:05:04,465
Fine by me.

60
00:05:04,985 --> 00:05:08,185
That's not what I stake my life upon.

61
00:05:08,265 --> 00:05:11,345
So calligraphy is merely a pastime for me.

62
00:05:15,905 --> 00:05:17,465
HIGH TIDE EBBS. FULL MOON FADES

63
00:05:18,825 --> 00:05:20,865
This is truly impressive.

64
00:05:20,945 --> 00:05:21,785
Right.

65
00:05:21,865 --> 00:05:22,865
In fact, it rivals Mr. Jing's work.

66
00:05:22,945 --> 00:05:24,265
She has clearly applied herself.

67
00:05:25,105 --> 00:05:26,665
Look, she's even varying her strokes.

68
00:05:27,585 --> 00:05:28,465
Quite impressive.

69
00:05:28,545 --> 00:05:30,025
Calligraphy is not about
who writes the fastest.

70
00:05:30,945 --> 00:05:32,185
-Indeed.
-Exactly.

71
00:05:35,465 --> 00:05:39,745
Mr. Jing, it is not about who writes
the most either.

72
00:05:42,225 --> 00:05:44,425
-Indeed.
-She certainly talks tough.

73
00:05:53,745 --> 00:05:55,825
Such clever wordplay.

74
00:05:55,905 --> 00:05:57,145
-Indeed.
-Exactly.

75
00:05:57,225 --> 00:05:58,345
Mr. Jing,

76
00:05:58,425 --> 00:06:00,705
do you even have the nerve
to keep slandering our literary gathering?

77
00:06:01,465 --> 00:06:02,825
Best of three.

78
00:06:02,905 --> 00:06:05,745
There is no need for a third round.

79
00:06:06,265 --> 00:06:08,585
Why further embarrass yourself?

80
00:06:10,105 --> 00:06:11,865
If you refuse to accept this, Mr. Jing,

81
00:06:11,945 --> 00:06:13,985
you are welcome to attend
the Chu Mansion Literary Gathering,

82
00:06:14,065 --> 00:06:16,225
where we can have a proper contest.

83
00:06:17,785 --> 00:06:19,625
-Go.
-You're not afraid of her, are you?

84
00:06:19,705 --> 00:06:20,625
‎-True!
‎-Don't worry.

85
00:06:20,705 --> 00:06:22,025
-Yes.
-Take her on.

86
00:06:27,345 --> 00:06:28,865
‎Let us see it.

87
00:06:28,945 --> 00:06:30,105
‎Such beautiful handwriting.

88
00:06:32,545 --> 00:06:33,585
Tang.

89
00:06:35,905 --> 00:06:39,865
Does it not trouble you
to have humiliated Minister Jing's son?

90
00:06:40,465 --> 00:06:41,825
I was only being high-profile

91
00:06:41,905 --> 00:06:44,585
so they would not underestimate
the Chu Mansion Literary Gathering.

92
00:06:45,345 --> 00:06:47,145
Mr. Jing has a bit of a reputation,

93
00:06:47,225 --> 00:06:48,825
so after this spectacle,

94
00:06:48,905 --> 00:06:51,345
many will surely come
to the gathering to watch the show.

95
00:06:55,945 --> 00:06:59,105
I have honored what Zhao entrusted to me.

96
00:07:02,305 --> 00:07:03,305
Let's go.

97
00:07:05,345 --> 00:07:06,545
A literary gathering?

98
00:07:08,145 --> 00:07:10,705
What are you planning this time?

99
00:07:15,105 --> 00:07:16,425
Who is it?

100
00:07:16,945 --> 00:07:19,225
Mr. Zhang, it's me.

101
00:07:23,985 --> 00:07:26,265
Young… Young Master.

102
00:07:26,345 --> 00:07:27,425
I came to see you.

103
00:07:28,625 --> 00:07:29,665
Take a seat.

104
00:07:45,065 --> 00:07:46,465
During the ancestral hall trial,

105
00:07:46,985 --> 00:07:49,025
you were the only one
who did not name me as the arsonist.

106
00:07:49,945 --> 00:07:52,225
I am grateful for that.

107
00:07:53,705 --> 00:07:55,625
I am but a servant.

108
00:07:56,145 --> 00:07:59,625
What standing do I have
to point fingers at you, Young Master?

109
00:07:59,705 --> 00:08:01,865
You need not keep this on your mind.

110
00:08:03,025 --> 00:08:06,105
I shall skip the liquor.

111
00:08:12,705 --> 00:08:13,945
It's alright,

112
00:08:14,905 --> 00:08:16,745
but can you tell me

113
00:08:18,505 --> 00:08:20,745
if the child brought out
from the Wei Village

114
00:08:24,745 --> 00:08:26,585
is still alive?

115
00:08:31,785 --> 00:08:33,105
CHU MANSION

116
00:08:33,185 --> 00:08:35,185
My parents are settled
at the Qiaoshan Academy

117
00:08:35,264 --> 00:08:36,985
and seem to be in much better spirits.

118
00:08:37,945 --> 00:08:40,625
And the yamen even allotted them
a plot of land.

119
00:08:42,865 --> 00:08:44,024
You may keep the land,

120
00:08:44,105 --> 00:08:45,905
but Uncle must accept
at least a hundred students

121
00:08:45,985 --> 00:08:46,825
without charging tuition.

122
00:08:47,825 --> 00:08:49,025
You want Father

123
00:08:49,105 --> 00:08:52,705
to use the proceeds from this land
to instruct and enlighten?

124
00:08:53,625 --> 00:08:56,905
He will earn far greater prestige
by serving the people thus.

125
00:08:59,905 --> 00:09:01,465
Father will surely agree.

126
00:09:01,545 --> 00:09:03,865
However, he has never paid attention
to financial matters.

127
00:09:03,945 --> 00:09:07,825
Mother will surely regret
this costly venture.

128
00:09:07,905 --> 00:09:09,105
This is a lesson to them both.

129
00:09:09,785 --> 00:09:11,705
Perhaps they will be more cautious
in their future dealings.

130
00:09:12,465 --> 00:09:15,345
Once greed takes hold,
it becomes a trap set by others.

131
00:09:16,025 --> 00:09:17,425
You are indeed insightful.

132
00:09:18,945 --> 00:09:19,785
By the way,

133
00:09:19,865 --> 00:09:23,705
your competition with Mr. Jing
at the teahouse proved quite effective.

134
00:09:23,785 --> 00:09:26,345
Many people have become interested
in the literary gathering.

135
00:09:27,025 --> 00:09:28,625
That owes entirely
to your brilliant planning.

136
00:09:30,785 --> 00:09:34,985
However, Zhao, most people
are hoping to see us fail.

137
00:09:35,705 --> 00:09:39,785
They claim that female scholars
must have ulterior motives

138
00:09:40,305 --> 00:09:43,505
and that this gathering
is merely a ploy to secure a good match.

139
00:09:44,185 --> 00:09:47,585
Why must they speak so harshly?

140
00:09:47,665 --> 00:09:49,025
Let them talk.

141
00:09:49,105 --> 00:09:50,105
Their words mean nothing anyway.

142
00:09:51,425 --> 00:09:54,505
They are merely men
whose pride has been bruised,

143
00:09:54,585 --> 00:09:56,585
seeking to salvage their dignity.

144
00:09:58,385 --> 00:10:04,305
On the day of the literary gathering,
we will show them who the true fools are.

145
00:10:08,225 --> 00:10:10,025
CHU MANSION LITERARY GATHERING

146
00:10:10,105 --> 00:10:12,585
Mr. Jing was careless and lost at Weiqi,

147
00:10:13,185 --> 00:10:15,585
which has made you all
insufferably arrogant.

148
00:10:16,545 --> 00:10:20,345
Today, I will show you what true shame is.

149
00:10:20,425 --> 00:10:22,785
Careful with your words.

150
00:10:23,385 --> 00:10:24,385
The board will decide.

151
00:10:25,385 --> 00:10:26,265
Fine.

152
00:10:26,785 --> 00:10:29,825
And if you lose, what then?

153
00:10:29,905 --> 00:10:30,785
If I lose,

154
00:10:31,385 --> 00:10:34,465
I will write a statement of defeat
and never play Weiqi again.

155
00:10:34,545 --> 00:10:36,065
What is that pathetic statement worth?

156
00:10:36,745 --> 00:10:39,865
Does one of your ilk
deserve a seat at a board like this?

157
00:10:39,945 --> 00:10:42,145
Mr. Peng, those are bold words indeed.

158
00:10:42,225 --> 00:10:44,385
‎What kind of talk is that?

159
00:10:48,225 --> 00:10:51,225
I do not feel
that what I said was improper.

160
00:10:54,505 --> 00:10:56,985
If Your Highness
insists on flaunting your power,

161
00:10:58,185 --> 00:10:59,385
I shall offer my apologies.

162
00:11:00,065 --> 00:11:01,465
If Miss Zhou loses,

163
00:11:01,545 --> 00:11:05,185
I will write a statement
of defeat with her.

164
00:11:05,265 --> 00:11:07,585
Do you accept this wager?

165
00:11:08,105 --> 00:11:09,065
Zhao.

166
00:11:10,025 --> 00:11:12,745
Your Highness, why go to such lengths?

167
00:11:12,825 --> 00:11:16,105
Because you are a woman, and so am I.

168
00:11:16,825 --> 00:11:19,865
If they look down on women,
they look down on all of us.

169
00:11:22,345 --> 00:11:24,185
So this is the real intention
behind Your Highness

170
00:11:24,265 --> 00:11:26,625
leading these women
to host a literary gathering.

171
00:11:27,145 --> 00:11:28,665
To back them up, huh?

172
00:11:29,985 --> 00:11:33,505
No. I only want to tell you

173
00:11:33,585 --> 00:11:36,345
that a woman's move on board
can also decide the fate of the world.

174
00:11:44,185 --> 00:11:46,825
Zhao, what game are you playing, exactly?

175
00:11:47,745 --> 00:11:49,305
If they win through sheer luck,
that is one thing,

176
00:11:50,385 --> 00:11:52,025
but should they lose,

177
00:11:52,105 --> 00:11:56,025
are you truly prepared
to write a statement of defeat?

178
00:11:56,105 --> 00:11:58,625
It does not matter.
I am not afraid of losing.

179
00:11:59,425 --> 00:12:00,905
So what if I have this title?

180
00:12:00,985 --> 00:12:03,585
Women have never held their respect.

181
00:12:04,105 --> 00:12:07,705
Even holding a high position
does not make them truly respect me,

182
00:12:07,785 --> 00:12:09,025
so there is nothing to fear.

183
00:12:10,065 --> 00:12:13,145
They come from scholarly families,
so they will not lose.

184
00:12:13,225 --> 00:12:14,465
Even if we lose, it does not matter.

185
00:12:14,985 --> 00:12:19,025
With each competition,
we draw closer to victory.

186
00:12:19,745 --> 00:12:22,305
And once we win, today's efforts
will not have been in vain.

187
00:12:23,105 --> 00:12:24,345
As I said before,

188
00:12:24,425 --> 00:12:27,345
the purpose of this gathering
is to demonstrate that women

189
00:12:27,425 --> 00:12:28,625
are capable of standing as equals to men.

190
00:12:30,985 --> 00:12:32,785
-She won.
-Incredible.

191
00:12:32,865 --> 00:12:34,145
Amazing.

192
00:12:35,145 --> 00:12:36,345
How impressive.

193
00:12:36,425 --> 00:12:37,425
We are taught

194
00:12:37,945 --> 00:12:39,545
from childhood to read, write,

195
00:12:39,625 --> 00:12:40,945
-Isn't that great?
-and master the Six Arts,

196
00:12:41,025 --> 00:12:44,185
yet we are also told
that all such learning serves

197
00:12:44,265 --> 00:12:45,985
to secure a good marriage,

198
00:12:46,065 --> 00:12:47,785
to support our husbands,
raise our children,

199
00:12:47,865 --> 00:12:48,905
and please our husbands' families.

200
00:12:49,825 --> 00:12:51,185
-Bravo!
-But today,

201
00:12:51,265 --> 00:12:53,585
we seek no one's favor.

202
00:12:54,305 --> 00:12:57,425
We are fighting for our own reputation.

203
00:13:04,025 --> 00:13:06,105
Your Highness, a letter from His Lordship.

204
00:13:15,545 --> 00:13:17,185
Father says

205
00:13:18,265 --> 00:13:20,665
the turmoil in the Capital
continues without pause

206
00:13:21,465 --> 00:13:23,425
and I should wait with patience.

207
00:13:26,065 --> 00:13:27,185
And yet

208
00:13:28,105 --> 00:13:33,305
every move he ever taught me
was built to kill.

209
00:13:36,505 --> 00:13:37,905
His Lordship still cares for you,
Your Highness.

210
00:13:40,105 --> 00:13:42,305
Tie Ying, grind the ink.

211
00:13:43,345 --> 00:13:44,185
Yes.

212
00:13:49,905 --> 00:13:51,025
Are you writing back, Your Highness?

213
00:13:55,385 --> 00:13:56,665
I'm writing to Deng Yi.

214
00:13:59,025 --> 00:13:59,985
Mr. Deng?

215
00:14:01,185 --> 00:14:03,985
He helped us flee the Capital,

216
00:14:04,585 --> 00:14:06,105
and yet Chu Zhao never moved against him.

217
00:14:06,625 --> 00:14:08,385
There must be some pact between them.

218
00:14:08,465 --> 00:14:10,345
The way things stand,

219
00:14:10,425 --> 00:14:12,345
he and we may no longer
share the same side.

220
00:14:12,945 --> 00:14:15,185
Whether we are or not doesn't matter.

221
00:14:16,265 --> 00:14:18,065
What he owes me…

222
00:14:21,945 --> 00:14:24,025
comes before all else.

223
00:14:41,265 --> 00:14:42,305
Your Highness.

224
00:14:42,905 --> 00:14:45,425
Since when do you bother
with such formalities?

225
00:14:47,505 --> 00:14:50,345
I hope I'm not interrupting.

226
00:14:52,105 --> 00:14:55,065
I came across a jade disc
and wanted to give it to you.

227
00:14:58,585 --> 00:15:01,385
Smooth to the touch, flawless in color.

228
00:15:02,145 --> 00:15:04,105
A rare piece indeed.

229
00:15:06,225 --> 00:15:07,745
My gratitude.

230
00:15:08,985 --> 00:15:11,305
Your Highness, please.

231
00:15:12,905 --> 00:15:14,225
Your Highness comes at such a late hour.

232
00:15:15,145 --> 00:15:16,425
I can only assume
it is a matter of urgency.

233
00:15:17,265 --> 00:15:18,945
I've received word

234
00:15:19,545 --> 00:15:21,465
that the Northern Desert King
has turned back.

235
00:15:21,985 --> 00:15:23,225
There may be movement on the frontier.

236
00:15:27,145 --> 00:15:28,625
I heard

237
00:15:28,705 --> 00:15:31,425
you once tried to send a trusted general
to Yunzhong Prefecture,

238
00:15:31,945 --> 00:15:34,905
only for Mr. Xie to block it
with the Grand Princess Token.

239
00:15:36,025 --> 00:15:39,265
Your concern for Yunzhong moves me,

240
00:15:39,985 --> 00:15:41,225
which is why I've come

241
00:15:41,305 --> 00:15:43,065
to discuss the appointment
of Guard General with you.

242
00:15:44,065 --> 00:15:45,225
What do you think of Xie Yanlai?

243
00:15:50,345 --> 00:15:52,625
You're locked in a contest
with the Xie Clan,

244
00:15:52,705 --> 00:15:53,865
and yet you'd hand command
of the frontier troops

245
00:15:53,945 --> 00:15:54,945
to one of their own?

246
00:15:56,145 --> 00:15:57,585
I warned you before,

247
00:15:57,665 --> 00:15:59,465
the Imperial Guard's authority
must never be entrusted so lightly.

248
00:15:59,545 --> 00:16:01,825
And now the frontier troops
are in Xie Yanlai's hands once again.

249
00:16:02,665 --> 00:16:04,625
Do you truly trust him,

250
00:16:04,705 --> 00:16:06,665
or are you counting on Xie Yanfang
not daring to touch him?

251
00:16:07,465 --> 00:16:10,145
Xie Yanlai serves me
and has nothing to do with the Xie Family.

252
00:16:10,225 --> 00:16:14,025
Your Highness may say so,
but to the rest of the world,

253
00:16:15,225 --> 00:16:16,425
he is a Xie.

254
00:16:17,545 --> 00:16:19,305
If the day comes when Xie Yanfang
forces him to choose,

255
00:16:19,385 --> 00:16:21,825
Your Highness,
what do you think he would do?

256
00:16:21,905 --> 00:16:23,625
He would choose me.

257
00:16:36,905 --> 00:16:39,065
Since Your Highness has made up your mind,

258
00:16:40,185 --> 00:16:41,385
I won't press further.

259
00:16:42,065 --> 00:16:43,865
I only hope that when victory
comes from the frontier,

260
00:16:43,945 --> 00:16:45,585
the glory won't end up adorning
someone else.

261
00:16:46,865 --> 00:16:47,985
You worry too much.

262
00:16:50,185 --> 00:16:52,905
The jade is fine.

263
00:16:53,865 --> 00:16:55,905
It just needs the most delicate of hands.

264
00:17:00,425 --> 00:17:02,385
She actually went to Deng Yi.

265
00:17:03,025 --> 00:17:05,585
Yes. They talked in private
for quite some time.

266
00:17:07,625 --> 00:17:10,385
Seems Chu Zhao already sees me as a rival

267
00:17:11,065 --> 00:17:12,905
and means to use Deng Yi to restrain me.

268
00:17:14,585 --> 00:17:15,905
Their next move

269
00:17:16,785 --> 00:17:19,145
should be to put Yanlai
in command of the frontier troops.

270
00:17:20,025 --> 00:17:22,025
If the military authority
falls to the Xie Clan,

271
00:17:22,105 --> 00:17:23,505
it is actually advantageous.

272
00:17:23,585 --> 00:17:24,545
No.

273
00:17:25,345 --> 00:17:26,905
Yanlai has changed.

274
00:17:29,265 --> 00:17:30,545
Fortunately,

275
00:17:31,385 --> 00:17:33,705
I still have a more obedient lapdog.

276
00:17:33,785 --> 00:17:36,385
Mr. Xie, your foresight
is truly remarkable.

277
00:17:38,305 --> 00:17:40,065
Though a piece be small,

278
00:17:40,585 --> 00:17:44,345
if used well, it can still stir
the winds of change.

279
00:17:45,185 --> 00:17:48,305
Have you met with Xiao Xun lately?

280
00:17:51,185 --> 00:17:52,985
He's a hostage.

281
00:17:53,065 --> 00:17:54,145
It wouldn't be proper for me to visit him.

282
00:17:54,985 --> 00:17:56,625
As Grand Mentor,

283
00:17:57,345 --> 00:17:59,745
you must extend your compassion to all,
be they the common folk

284
00:18:00,265 --> 00:18:01,745
or the officials of the court.

285
00:18:02,265 --> 00:18:06,105
Keeping such a deliberate distance
from him

286
00:18:06,865 --> 00:18:07,945
will raise suspicions.

287
00:18:10,425 --> 00:18:13,305
Your Highness has made clear
I should stand with you.

288
00:18:13,945 --> 00:18:15,225
Why test me?

289
00:18:16,545 --> 00:18:17,825
Unless

290
00:18:19,065 --> 00:18:21,105
there's been talk about me?

291
00:18:24,225 --> 00:18:25,305
Nothing of the sort.

292
00:18:26,185 --> 00:18:27,625
Just making conversation.

293
00:18:27,705 --> 00:18:30,825
Your Highness, I give everything I have

294
00:18:31,425 --> 00:18:33,665
to the State of Chu, to my last breath.

295
00:18:34,345 --> 00:18:35,385
My loyalty is absolute.

296
00:18:38,945 --> 00:18:42,345
I know where your loyalty lies.

297
00:18:44,825 --> 00:18:46,065
It's late.

298
00:18:46,705 --> 00:18:47,825
I should not keep you any longer.

299
00:18:54,745 --> 00:18:56,505
As for the appointment of the commander,

300
00:18:57,025 --> 00:18:59,945
I hope you will give it
further careful consideration.

301
00:19:00,585 --> 00:19:01,825
Do not rush into a decision.

302
00:19:15,785 --> 00:19:16,865
Mr. Deng,

303
00:19:16,945 --> 00:19:19,425
Her Highness and you
have gone your separate ways.

304
00:19:19,505 --> 00:19:20,665
I know.

305
00:19:21,625 --> 00:19:23,065
In this game,

306
00:19:24,065 --> 00:19:26,145
the isolated stone
is always the first to fall.

307
00:19:26,865 --> 00:19:32,105
We must plan ahead
and do what we must to survive.

308
00:19:33,785 --> 00:19:36,505
Mr. Deng, this is a letter from Mr. Xiao.

309
00:19:44,105 --> 00:19:47,145
<i>My divination has progressed considerably.</i>

310
00:19:47,665 --> 00:19:49,865
<i>I finally understand what it means</i>
<i>for greatness yet to emerge.</i>

311
00:19:50,385 --> 00:19:52,705
<i>And I've never thanked you</i>
<i>for your guidance.</i>

312
00:20:18,545 --> 00:20:21,065
FERRYMAN’S LODGE

313
00:20:30,785 --> 00:20:34,665
These palace robes are such a bother,
so stiff and confining.

314
00:20:35,265 --> 00:20:36,705
They're nothing like the simple clothes
I wore before.

315
00:20:37,585 --> 00:20:40,025
Clumsy as you are,
how could you serve our lady?

316
00:20:40,105 --> 00:20:41,505
Give it to me.

317
00:20:41,585 --> 00:20:45,065
Le, take her to change
into something lighter.

318
00:20:45,145 --> 00:20:46,185
She need not dress like a palace maid.

319
00:20:46,825 --> 00:20:47,985
Cold mask, warm heart.

320
00:20:48,065 --> 00:20:49,065
You're just like your mother,
Your Highness.

321
00:20:50,665 --> 00:20:52,825
Mother? Whose mother?

322
00:20:53,425 --> 00:20:54,905
Your Highness's mother?

323
00:20:54,985 --> 00:20:56,425
Also my aunt.

324
00:20:57,865 --> 00:20:59,105
Don't ask any more.

325
00:21:00,705 --> 00:21:03,425
I once read Her Highness's fortune.

326
00:21:03,505 --> 00:21:04,945
The divination showed
her mother was still alive.

327
00:21:05,625 --> 00:21:07,985
I thought I had misread
the cracks in the tortoise shell.

328
00:21:09,305 --> 00:21:11,705
You can read fortunes? That accurately?

329
00:21:12,225 --> 00:21:13,505
Cast one for me too, would you?

330
00:21:14,905 --> 00:21:15,745
No.

331
00:21:17,025 --> 00:21:17,865
Fine.

332
00:21:21,265 --> 00:21:22,465
Alright, I'll do it.

333
00:21:33,985 --> 00:21:34,825
Well?

334
00:21:36,305 --> 00:21:37,225
A letter from afar.

335
00:21:37,905 --> 00:21:39,105
You can tell that from the bones?

336
00:21:40,665 --> 00:21:42,145
I used my eyes.

337
00:21:46,465 --> 00:21:48,265
Your Highness, a message
from the dispatch rider.

338
00:21:51,465 --> 00:21:53,265
It's from Xie Yanlai.

339
00:22:09,225 --> 00:22:10,065
What is it?

340
00:22:10,145 --> 00:22:14,385
Jiu discovered shards of incendiary jars
in the Wei Village ruins,

341
00:22:14,465 --> 00:22:16,585
bearing part of a cargo mark.

342
00:22:18,665 --> 00:22:20,065
Incendiary jars?

343
00:22:20,145 --> 00:22:22,345
Someone used them to set fires?

344
00:22:23,825 --> 00:22:25,105
Xinsi, Fourth Month.

345
00:22:25,185 --> 00:22:26,985
Danqiu Horse Administration.

346
00:22:27,065 --> 00:22:28,305
Contract Three.

347
00:22:29,625 --> 00:22:30,665
What does that mean?

348
00:22:31,265 --> 00:22:33,785
Danqiu refers to the Xiaonan Prefecture
stud farm.

349
00:22:36,345 --> 00:22:38,385
This came from Xiaonan Prefecture.

350
00:22:40,785 --> 00:22:44,145
Mr. Deng is thoughtful,
looking out for Your Highness.

351
00:22:44,225 --> 00:22:47,705
I've heard that someone has been
investigating the Wei Village in secret.

352
00:22:48,505 --> 00:22:50,025
But after the village was burned,

353
00:22:50,545 --> 00:22:53,505
all the cargo records
from Xiaonan Prefecture were destroyed.

354
00:22:54,265 --> 00:22:55,865
There's no way to uncover the truth.

355
00:22:55,945 --> 00:22:57,585
Yet I worry someone won't let this go

356
00:22:57,665 --> 00:22:58,745
and will seize the chance
to stir up trouble.

357
00:23:10,025 --> 00:23:12,025
Your concerns are not without merit.

358
00:23:13,585 --> 00:23:16,225
Go and keep close watch.

359
00:23:17,265 --> 00:23:19,185
Nothing can come to light.

360
00:23:19,265 --> 00:23:21,145
If that fire at the Wei Village

361
00:23:22,905 --> 00:23:24,305
ever gets traced back to us,

362
00:23:24,385 --> 00:23:26,585
the charge of colluding
with the Northern Desert

363
00:23:27,705 --> 00:23:29,585
would finish us for good.

364
00:23:31,145 --> 00:23:32,265
Understood.

365
00:24:09,745 --> 00:24:11,225
Still expecting your father to rescue you?

366
00:24:15,825 --> 00:24:18,505
Xiaonan Prefecture can barely stay afloat.

367
00:24:18,585 --> 00:24:21,385
As his stone, you are certainly spent.

368
00:24:22,145 --> 00:24:27,425
Your Highness came all this way
only to offer such hollow mockery?

369
00:24:28,025 --> 00:24:28,985
No.

370
00:24:29,505 --> 00:24:33,665
I came to tell you
that I could choose not to kill you,

371
00:24:34,265 --> 00:24:37,745
but I could also keep you in the Capital,
a hostage until your last breath.

372
00:24:39,705 --> 00:24:42,145
I know your father sent you a letter.

373
00:24:43,265 --> 00:24:45,065
Do you really think
he wants to rescue you?

374
00:24:46,305 --> 00:24:51,625
This letter appears to offer reassurance,
but it is meant to keep you here.

375
00:24:52,705 --> 00:24:54,225
If you attempt to flee,

376
00:24:54,305 --> 00:24:56,705
you prove that Xiaonan Prefecture
plotted this all along,

377
00:24:57,225 --> 00:24:58,865
committing treason
and deceiving His Majesty.

378
00:25:06,745 --> 00:25:10,185
Do you know what he said to me
in Xiaonan Prefecture?

379
00:25:10,905 --> 00:25:15,065
"I have one wife and three concubines,

380
00:25:15,705 --> 00:25:17,545
-with seven children in total--"
-Enough.

381
00:25:19,705 --> 00:25:20,945
What?

382
00:25:22,105 --> 00:25:23,145
Are you furious?

383
00:25:24,705 --> 00:25:28,465
Helplessness feels awful, doesn't it?

384
00:25:29,065 --> 00:25:30,345
Your Highness.

385
00:25:31,945 --> 00:25:33,465
Why back me into a corner like this?

386
00:25:34,385 --> 00:25:38,505
You're pressing so relentlessly
just to hear me say

387
00:25:39,305 --> 00:25:40,825
that I want to go back
to Xiaonan Prefecture, aren't you?

388
00:25:47,865 --> 00:25:49,025
But I won't say it.

389
00:25:51,425 --> 00:25:53,385
I like this courtyard.

390
00:25:53,985 --> 00:25:56,225
Small and delicate.

391
00:25:58,145 --> 00:26:02,785
Your Highness, I wish you
confined to these walls forever.

392
00:26:04,545 --> 00:26:07,945
Let's see whether you're destined to rise…

393
00:26:10,065 --> 00:26:11,265
or doomed to fade away.

394
00:26:22,905 --> 00:26:25,425
CHU MANSION

395
00:26:25,505 --> 00:26:28,505
Zhao, Jiang was brilliant,

396
00:26:28,585 --> 00:26:31,345
besting one scholar after another
at the Chu Mansion Literary Gathering.

397
00:26:32,105 --> 00:26:34,345
A triumph for women indeed.

398
00:26:34,985 --> 00:26:36,105
Jiang's mastery of Weiqi

399
00:26:36,185 --> 00:26:38,545
was always meant
to shine on a larger board.

400
00:26:39,585 --> 00:26:41,145
All these years of dedicated study,

401
00:26:41,225 --> 00:26:42,985
and now the world finally understands

402
00:26:43,065 --> 00:26:46,465
the board makes no distinction
between men and women.

403
00:26:50,145 --> 00:26:52,145
By the way, I heard

404
00:26:52,225 --> 00:26:54,745
Mr. Deng has been withholding
military honors

405
00:26:54,825 --> 00:26:56,105
from the Battle
Against the Northern Desert,

406
00:26:56,185 --> 00:26:57,625
leaving the court rife with speculation.

407
00:26:58,705 --> 00:27:01,625
Do you know what game he is playing?

408
00:27:01,705 --> 00:27:03,225
What else could it be?

409
00:27:03,305 --> 00:27:05,905
The only one he means
to hold back is Xie Yanlai.

410
00:27:06,505 --> 00:27:08,665
With the Guard General post vacant,

411
00:27:08,745 --> 00:27:11,305
every ambitious eye in court
is set upon it.

412
00:27:11,985 --> 00:27:14,825
Do you really think
he would stand with you?

413
00:27:17,265 --> 00:27:18,625
Your Highness,

414
00:27:18,705 --> 00:27:20,465
are you considering sending
Xie Yanlai to guard the frontier?

415
00:27:23,865 --> 00:27:26,745
Yunzhong Prefecture
is a key stronghold on the frontier,

416
00:27:27,545 --> 00:27:30,265
and he was the one
Father and Mr. Zhong chose.

417
00:27:31,265 --> 00:27:32,185
But he comes from the Xie Family,

418
00:27:32,825 --> 00:27:34,705
and Deng Yi has always been wary of them
holding military power,

419
00:27:35,225 --> 00:27:36,465
not to mention

420
00:27:37,745 --> 00:27:39,345
over a fortress like Yunzhong.

421
00:27:42,785 --> 00:27:43,865
So…

422
00:27:45,345 --> 00:27:48,905
I'm going to force the issue at court.

423
00:28:03,265 --> 00:28:04,385
Mr. Deng,

424
00:28:04,465 --> 00:28:07,425
why is Xie Yanlai absent
from the list of honors

425
00:28:07,505 --> 00:28:08,665
for the Battle
Against the Northern Desert?

426
00:28:09,905 --> 00:28:11,305
Breaking through Yingzui Valley

427
00:28:11,385 --> 00:28:13,025
and dealing a heavy blow
to the Northern Desert King.

428
00:28:13,105 --> 00:28:14,985
Do these not deserve
the highest commendation?

429
00:28:15,585 --> 00:28:18,625
Moreover, he was personally recommended
by the late General Chu

430
00:28:18,705 --> 00:28:21,865
as the most qualified successor
for Guard General.

431
00:28:21,945 --> 00:28:27,265
The post is of critical importance
and cannot simply be dictated.

432
00:28:28,145 --> 00:28:29,585
If it were a hereditary title,

433
00:28:29,665 --> 00:28:31,025
the person most fit
to lead the frontier troops

434
00:28:31,105 --> 00:28:33,065
would be Your Highness.

435
00:28:33,145 --> 00:28:34,905
Unfortunately, as you cannot
hold the post yourself,

436
00:28:35,425 --> 00:28:38,745
someone else must take the place.

437
00:28:39,345 --> 00:28:40,385
Furthermore,

438
00:28:40,905 --> 00:28:44,065
when Your Highness appointed Xie Yanlai
as Imperial Guard Commander,

439
00:28:44,145 --> 00:28:46,705
he deserted his duties.

440
00:28:47,225 --> 00:28:48,545
According to the law,
he should be executed.

441
00:28:49,945 --> 00:28:51,065
How could there be any rewards?

442
00:28:53,825 --> 00:28:55,145
Mr. Xie, do you remember

443
00:28:55,745 --> 00:28:56,665
that if Xie Yanlai

444
00:28:56,745 --> 00:28:58,345
had not detected the unrest
in Xiaonan Prefecture,

445
00:28:58,945 --> 00:29:02,545
Xiao Xun's blade would already
be at His Majesty's throat?

446
00:29:03,185 --> 00:29:05,665
Why are you so bent
on castigating Commander Xie?

447
00:29:07,185 --> 00:29:09,825
Even if Your Highness orders my death,

448
00:29:10,465 --> 00:29:12,105
I must speak.

449
00:29:13,025 --> 00:29:15,705
The law is absolute
and cannot be overturned.

450
00:29:15,785 --> 00:29:18,385
Xie Yanlai defied imperial orders,
and that is a fact.

451
00:29:19,145 --> 00:29:20,305
If he is not severely punished,

452
00:29:21,065 --> 00:29:22,905
I fear others will follow suit,

453
00:29:22,985 --> 00:29:25,265
and the court will descend into chaos.

454
00:29:25,905 --> 00:29:27,665
What is your take on this?

455
00:29:28,425 --> 00:29:30,825
By law, he deserves death.

456
00:29:42,945 --> 00:29:45,785
XIE RESIDENCE

457
00:29:53,105 --> 00:29:54,425
Yanlai has returned to the Capital?

458
00:29:55,185 --> 00:29:56,425
But strangely,

459
00:29:56,505 --> 00:29:58,545
from the You hour the day before yesterday
until the Zi hour last night,

460
00:29:58,625 --> 00:29:59,745
he left no trace.

461
00:30:00,505 --> 00:30:01,945
Our people lost him.

462
00:30:02,545 --> 00:30:03,785
This is interesting.

463
00:30:04,505 --> 00:30:08,425
He is not by Chu Zhao's side
but chooses to move alone.

464
00:30:09,985 --> 00:30:12,025
Something serious must be happening.

465
00:30:13,065 --> 00:30:16,025
No matter. Keep watching him.

466
00:30:19,905 --> 00:30:21,105
How is the court?

467
00:30:21,625 --> 00:30:22,945
Mr. Xie, your plan was brilliant.

468
00:30:23,025 --> 00:30:24,425
You feigned illness
and absented yourself this morning.

469
00:30:24,505 --> 00:30:25,545
The court has indeed seen stirrings.

470
00:30:26,145 --> 00:30:27,585
Her Highness requested
that Xie Yanlai be named

471
00:30:27,665 --> 00:30:29,465
Guard General on the grounds
of his military achievements.

472
00:30:30,705 --> 00:30:31,985
How did Mr. Deng react?

473
00:30:32,065 --> 00:30:33,305
He immediately claimed

474
00:30:33,385 --> 00:30:36,465
Xie Yanlai had abandoned his duties
and should be executed.

475
00:30:37,585 --> 00:30:39,465
If he actually kills Yanlai,

476
00:30:40,105 --> 00:30:42,345
Her Highness will surely not let it go.

477
00:30:43,065 --> 00:30:45,145
But if Her Highness grants the title,

478
00:30:46,145 --> 00:30:48,625
our military power
will grow even stronger.

479
00:30:49,265 --> 00:30:51,145
A true dilemma.

480
00:30:52,185 --> 00:30:53,345
There is one more thing.

481
00:30:54,385 --> 00:30:56,265
Deng Yi has met with Xiao Xun
three times recently,

482
00:30:56,345 --> 00:30:58,705
always after the Zi hour.

483
00:30:58,785 --> 00:31:00,025
Interesting.

484
00:31:02,385 --> 00:31:04,345
Mr. Deng usually knows
how to read the wind.

485
00:31:05,105 --> 00:31:07,825
Why cling to a dead branch now?

486
00:31:10,985 --> 00:31:12,745
Perhaps Xiao Xun
has something else planned?

487
00:31:13,705 --> 00:31:15,225
Should we take precautions in advance?

488
00:31:17,265 --> 00:31:18,345
Let us wait and see.

489
00:31:21,065 --> 00:31:22,825
Do not alert him.

490
00:31:24,665 --> 00:31:25,665
Understood.

491
00:31:33,905 --> 00:31:36,905
Her Highness has arrived.

492
00:31:47,105 --> 00:31:48,265
Your Highness.

493
00:31:48,985 --> 00:31:50,265
Yanfang, your health comes first.

494
00:31:50,345 --> 00:31:51,185
There's no need for such formalities.

495
00:31:51,785 --> 00:31:55,625
It seems nothing escapes
Your Highness's keen eyes.

496
00:31:59,305 --> 00:32:01,065
I am deeply honored by your visit.

497
00:32:01,145 --> 00:32:02,385
Please, this way.

498
00:32:10,905 --> 00:32:14,545
Your Highness, Yanlai
is indeed important to you,

499
00:32:14,625 --> 00:32:18,745
but are you not afraid that Deng Yi
will seize this opportunity to strike?

500
00:32:21,225 --> 00:32:23,505
Xie Yanlai is your brother.

501
00:32:24,025 --> 00:32:25,945
Deng Yi is clamoring for his blood,

502
00:32:27,105 --> 00:32:29,025
yet you sit here with your hands folded?

503
00:32:29,705 --> 00:32:32,065
Your Highness truly misjudges me.

504
00:32:33,905 --> 00:32:34,745
As his elder brother,

505
00:32:34,825 --> 00:32:36,945
I have shouldered so much
for Yanlai since we were children.

506
00:32:38,345 --> 00:32:39,785
The Xie Family has stood for a century.

507
00:32:39,865 --> 00:32:42,585
I cannot let his reckless behavior

508
00:32:43,345 --> 00:32:44,905
endanger the entire clan.

509
00:32:46,185 --> 00:32:48,425
I want to save him more than anyone,

510
00:32:49,585 --> 00:32:51,105
but now…

511
00:32:52,785 --> 00:32:54,145
my hands are tied.

512
00:32:55,105 --> 00:32:56,785
Tied?

513
00:32:57,625 --> 00:33:02,785
Your acting now matches
your mastery of the game.

514
00:33:05,025 --> 00:33:06,145
Shouldering for him, you say?

515
00:33:08,505 --> 00:33:10,505
You are fully aware
that he never set fire to the Wei village.

516
00:33:12,225 --> 00:33:16,505
Yet why did you allow this crime
to be placed upon him?

517
00:33:19,505 --> 00:33:21,625
It was to use this as leverage

518
00:33:22,465 --> 00:33:25,145
to restrain the most dangerous threat
within the Xie Family.

519
00:33:36,625 --> 00:33:37,785
You know.

520
00:33:38,425 --> 00:33:39,545
Regardless,

521
00:33:40,065 --> 00:33:43,225
Xie Yanlai holding military power
is beneficial to the Xie Family.

522
00:33:44,145 --> 00:33:47,465
I hope you will lend your support.

523
00:34:01,945 --> 00:34:07,785
She has changed anyway.

524
00:34:15,625 --> 00:34:16,824
Why are you still awake?

525
00:34:16,905 --> 00:34:18,225
I don't want to sleep.

526
00:34:18,304 --> 00:34:22,225
Every time I close my eyes, I think
of Mr. Deng's outburst in court today.

527
00:34:22,304 --> 00:34:25,505
He says Uncle Yanlai should be killed,
but I do not want to kill him.

528
00:34:29,065 --> 00:34:29,985
Rest assured.

529
00:34:30,505 --> 00:34:31,744
Tomorrow in court,

530
00:34:31,824 --> 00:34:36,145
I will make everyone realize
who is truly worthy of trust.

531
00:34:37,505 --> 00:34:38,465
You have a plan?

532
00:34:40,225 --> 00:34:42,425
You will see tomorrow. Go to sleep.

533
00:35:23,585 --> 00:35:24,465
You have returned.

534
00:35:25,665 --> 00:35:26,665
I have.

535
00:35:53,105 --> 00:35:54,225
Have you found any clues?

536
00:35:55,385 --> 00:35:57,865
I have uncovered some details
about the Wei Village incident,

537
00:35:58,865 --> 00:36:00,145
but it involves many parties.

538
00:36:00,665 --> 00:36:02,105
I need to conduct
a more thorough investigation.

539
00:36:02,705 --> 00:36:05,225
Is it related to the incendiary
jar fragments you sent back?

540
00:36:08,945 --> 00:36:12,185
You went back to Gaoyang
to investigate the Bloodburn Pill,

541
00:36:13,185 --> 00:36:14,465
so how did it lead to the Wei Village?

542
00:36:16,945 --> 00:36:21,025
I did not find the Bloodburn Pill
in the Xie Family's medicinal storage.

543
00:36:21,745 --> 00:36:25,225
Instead, I discovered that Xie Yanfang
is using a type of medicine

544
00:36:25,745 --> 00:36:27,105
to keep a child alive.

545
00:36:27,745 --> 00:36:28,945
A child?

546
00:36:31,065 --> 00:36:32,265
Xiang?

547
00:36:33,905 --> 00:36:35,865
Although I have not found
where he is hidden,

548
00:36:36,665 --> 00:36:40,065
I believe he is alive.

549
00:36:41,305 --> 00:36:42,865
Xie Yanfang keeping him hidden

550
00:36:43,705 --> 00:36:46,065
must have something to do
with that fire back then.

551
00:36:51,225 --> 00:36:52,425
That incendiary jar fragment

552
00:36:52,945 --> 00:36:54,905
clearly bore the caravan mark
of Xiaonan Prefecture.

553
00:36:55,505 --> 00:36:58,385
The oil was definitely from there.

554
00:36:59,185 --> 00:37:02,065
Yet, the mark left at the scene
belongs to the Cangmu Stronghold.

555
00:37:02,145 --> 00:37:05,265
It's a blatant frame-up.

556
00:37:05,345 --> 00:37:10,425
You mean someone wanted to use that fire
to force my mother out?

557
00:37:10,505 --> 00:37:11,345
What secret

558
00:37:11,425 --> 00:37:13,905
does the Cangmu Stronghold have
that requires such drastic measures?

559
00:37:14,865 --> 00:37:17,545
It must be your mother's identity
as a Northern Desert general.

560
00:37:20,265 --> 00:37:21,985
If someone intended to use that fire

561
00:37:22,585 --> 00:37:24,065
to provoke an imperial investigation
into the Cangmu Stronghold,

562
00:37:24,945 --> 00:37:26,745
your mother's identity
would certainly be exposed.

563
00:37:27,785 --> 00:37:29,465
Your father would have been accused
of deceiving His Majesty

564
00:37:29,985 --> 00:37:31,265
and stripped of his position.

565
00:37:32,745 --> 00:37:34,305
This must be
the Northern Desert King's doing.

566
00:37:36,025 --> 00:37:39,985
A scheme this interconnected
cannot be executed without an insider.

567
00:37:40,585 --> 00:37:42,545
Xiao Xun left no loose ends.

568
00:37:43,305 --> 00:37:44,625
I need concrete evidence.

569
00:37:45,825 --> 00:37:47,105
Is there anything I can do?

570
00:37:48,105 --> 00:37:49,025
Zhao,

571
00:37:50,545 --> 00:37:51,785
this matter involves
far more than you know.

572
00:37:52,385 --> 00:37:55,625
It touches on your mother
and your origins.

573
00:37:56,665 --> 00:37:57,945
So you must do nothing.

574
00:37:58,825 --> 00:38:00,825
Should you be discovered,
disaster will follow.

575
00:38:02,345 --> 00:38:03,465
Zhao,

576
00:38:03,985 --> 00:38:07,185
what happened at Wei Village
matters greatly to both of us.

577
00:38:07,705 --> 00:38:10,185
I will get to the bottom of it,

578
00:38:10,905 --> 00:38:14,145
but I will investigate with care
and ensure Xie Yanfang remains unaware.

579
00:38:15,345 --> 00:38:16,505
Zhao,

580
00:38:17,025 --> 00:38:18,945
I have heard about what happened at court.

581
00:38:20,105 --> 00:38:21,305
If you truly insist on defending me,

582
00:38:22,185 --> 00:38:24,625
Mr. Deng will certainly weaponize
my unauthorized absence against you,

583
00:38:25,345 --> 00:38:27,425
and he might even force you
to step aside from governance.

584
00:38:30,305 --> 00:38:32,105
But you earned your military merits.

585
00:38:35,905 --> 00:38:40,985
I used to seek only to die
on the battlefield for a moment's glory,

586
00:38:42,345 --> 00:38:46,745
but now, I only want to live long enough
to keep one person safe.

587
00:38:54,705 --> 00:38:55,825
Who is that person?

588
00:38:56,985 --> 00:39:00,345
General Xie, you might as well be clear.

589
00:39:34,705 --> 00:39:36,305
Would you ever lie to me?

590
00:39:42,185 --> 00:39:43,025
Never.

591
00:39:44,465 --> 00:39:45,465
Zhao.

592
00:39:46,305 --> 00:39:47,425
By the moon itself,

593
00:39:49,505 --> 00:39:50,745
I never will.

594
00:40:08,185 --> 00:40:10,625
My father wished you to take command
of the frontier troops.

595
00:40:13,705 --> 00:40:14,545
Would you do it?

596
00:40:15,225 --> 00:40:19,545
For you and the General,
there's nothing I wouldn't do.

597
00:40:20,625 --> 00:40:24,145
But you must promise me
never again to put yourself in harm's way

598
00:40:24,225 --> 00:40:25,745
to deal with Deng Yi alone.

599
00:40:26,705 --> 00:40:29,625
Tomorrow at court,
I'll fight for it myself.

600
00:40:58,745 --> 00:41:01,665
I petition again
for Liang Qiang's appointment.

601
00:41:01,745 --> 00:41:02,585
It cannot be allowed.

602
00:41:08,145 --> 00:41:10,305
Your Highness, your persistent meddling
in state affairs

603
00:41:10,385 --> 00:41:12,025
is strictly prohibited
in the inner palace.

604
00:41:12,905 --> 00:41:13,905
I implore you, Your Highness,

605
00:41:13,985 --> 00:41:15,865
to withdraw
to the Grand Princess's Residence

606
00:41:15,945 --> 00:41:17,465
and never again interfere
in affairs of state.

607
00:41:20,905 --> 00:41:22,145
I, Xie Yanlai,

608
00:41:22,785 --> 00:41:26,225
pay my respect to Your Majesty
and Your Highness.

609
00:41:32,225 --> 00:41:36,065
‎DILIGENT AND VIRTUOUS

610
00:41:36,665 --> 00:41:39,225
I pledge my life on my duty.

611
00:41:40,185 --> 00:41:43,425
Within half a year… I shall claim
the Northern Desert King's head.

612
00:41:44,745 --> 00:41:47,465
Should I fail,
let military law take its course.

613
00:41:55,385 --> 00:41:56,425
Mr. Xie.

614
00:41:57,225 --> 00:41:58,385
You would align yourself with him?

615
00:42:02,665 --> 00:42:04,545
Since Yanlai has set his heart upon it…

616
00:42:05,745 --> 00:42:07,745
I shall spare no effort in his aid.

617
00:42:09,465 --> 00:42:10,785
Your Highness, please do not consent.

618
00:42:11,505 --> 00:42:12,985
If the Northern Desert marches upon us,

619
00:42:13,065 --> 00:42:14,385
the frontier will descend into turmoil.

620
00:42:14,465 --> 00:42:15,425
We cannot risk another war.

621
00:42:15,505 --> 00:42:17,185
Cowardice.

622
00:42:17,265 --> 00:42:18,545
But if we take the King's head,

623
00:42:18,625 --> 00:42:20,265
will it not be the time
to proclaim our might?

624
00:42:20,345 --> 00:42:23,025
-We cannot go to war!
-We must.

625
00:42:23,105 --> 00:42:24,825
‎NORTHERN RAIDERS INVADE. I BEG TO FIGHT.
‎IF FAIL IN SIX MONTHS, I SHALL BE PUNISHED

626
00:42:26,345 --> 00:42:27,545
I grant it.

627
00:42:27,625 --> 00:42:28,785
‎What?

628
00:42:28,865 --> 00:42:30,345
General Xie is hereby ordered

629
00:42:30,425 --> 00:42:33,745
to hold Yunzhong Prefecture
and assume the Guard General's Seal.

